WEBVTT

28:04.125 --> 28:07.254
alongside his valiant brothers-in-arms.

28:07.379 --> 28:09.005
The Night's Watch protects
the realm from...

28:09.130 --> 28:12.467
Ah, yes, yes, against
grumpkins and snarks

28:12.592 --> 28:16.096
and all the other monsters
your wet nurse warned you about.

28:16.221 --> 28:18.515
You're a smart boy.

28:18.640 --> 28:21.059
You don't believe that nonsense.

28:28.650 --> 28:31.528
Everything's better
with some wine in the belly.
